From 77fffcdb084a8335d43db7aa92732dc2a144b526 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dagoomax <dagoomax@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 20:35:45 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] SD-card playback for H.264 cameras, start timeout

- `cameras recordings <camera> <YYYY-MM-DD> [--json]` lists a day's SD-card
  segments (protocol 312 recordQueryByDay on a replay session; pages arrive
  out of order and some never arrive, so collect until quiet)
- RTSP /<camera>/replay/<start>-<end> plays one segment (playbackStart);
  the camera serves one replay session at a time, at 1x, video only
- Bridge start gives up after 20s instead of waiting forever while the
  stream lock is held

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
